    "CardWorkspace.__init__: [DEPENDENCY_BOUNDARY] MUST retain the supplied per-operation CabinetUnitOfWork factory for durable Card revision state and initialize no transport, credential policy, database connection, or environment reader. Across the module, every persisted, emitted, or compared wall-clock timestamp MUST be timezone-aware UTC and MUST NOT be a naive datetime.",
