    "EffectJournal.__init__: [DEPENDENCY_BOUNDARY] MUST retain the supplied per-operation CabinetUnitOfWork factory and MUST NOT receive a database URL, share an active transaction, construct adapters, or read environment variables. Across the module, every persisted, emitted, or compared wall-clock timestamp MUST be timezone-aware UTC and MUST NOT be a naive datetime.",
    "InvoiceExchange.__init__: [DEPENDENCY_BOUNDARY] MUST retain the per-operation CabinetUnitOfWork factory, exact Card workspace, and source custody without receiving a database URL or creating an outbound VPS connector. Across the module, every persisted, emitted, or compared wall-clock timestamp MUST be timezone-aware UTC and MUST NOT be a naive datetime.",
    "InvoiceWorkspace.__init__: [DEPENDENCY_BOUNDARY] MUST depend only on the supplied CabinetUnitOfWorkFactory and canonical CardWorkspace; it MUST NOT accept a database URL, construct persistence adapters, own source bytes, or perform transport work. Across the module, every persisted, emitted, or compared wall-clock timestamp MUST be timezone-aware UTC and MUST NOT be a naive datetime. Every owned callable MUST implement its complete specified read, validation, ordering, mutation, and return behavior; an unconditional rejection, empty result, fixed success, or other fail-closed placeholder body is forbidden.",
    "InvoiceWorkspace.__init__: [FIELD_ASSIGNMENT] MUST retain the exact supplied unit_of_work_factory and card_workspace as the service dependencies used by every Invoice operation, without opening a transaction during construction.",
    "ProjectWorkspace.__init__: [DEPENDENCY_BOUNDARY] MUST retain the per-operation CabinetUnitOfWork factory and canonical Card workspace without receiving a database URL or importing Registry master authority. Across the module, every persisted, emitted, or compared wall-clock timestamp MUST be timezone-aware UTC and MUST NOT be a naive datetime.",
    "RegistryReplicaService.__init__: [DEPENDENCY_BOUNDARY] MUST retain the per-operation CabinetUnitOfWork factory for received Registry replica state and never receive a database URL or mutable Registry master connection. Across the module, every persisted, emitted, or compared wall-clock timestamp MUST be timezone-aware UTC and MUST NOT be a naive datetime.",
