    "LocalFilesystemSourceByteStore.__init__: [SECURITY_BOUNDARY] MUST require one absolute non-symlink private directory, create confined staging and final subdirectories with owner-only permissions, verify they share one filesystem, and fail construction without serving traffic when confinement or atomic rename cannot be guaranteed; MUST NOT read environment variables or log the root.",
    "LocalFilesystemSourceByteStore.final_reference_for: [DETERMINISM_OR_ORDERING] MUST accept only one lowercase 64-hex SHA-256 value and return the unique opaque content-addressed reference beneath the final namespace; MUST NOT accept separators, relative components, or caller filenames.",
