    "LocalFilesystemSourceByteStore.verify: [SECURITY_BOUNDARY] MUST resolve only a canonical opaque staging or final reference beneath the configured root, reject symlinks and non-regular files, reopen and stream-hash it, and return true only for the exact expected size and SHA-256 without exposing a path.",
